00:01:10.497 --> 00:01:13.200
EXPANDING ACCESS TO HEALTH CARE.

00:01:11.899 --> 00:01:15.936
REDUCING WAIT TIMES AND WORKING

00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:17.538
CLOSER WITH THE PRIVATE SECTOR.

00:01:16.069 --> 00:01:19.673
SHULKIN SAYS THE PERCENTAGE OF

00:01:17.671 --> 00:01:22.810
VETERANS WHO REGAINED TRUST IN

00:01:19.807 --> 00:01:24.311
THE V.A. HAS RISEN FROM 46% FOUR

00:01:22.943 --> 00:01:25.846
YEARS AGO TO 74% TODAY.

00:01:24.444 --> 00:01:26.847
STILL, HE STRUGGLED TO WIN OVER

00:01:25.979 --> 00:01:27.915
CONGRESS AND EVEN VETS.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.684
&gt;&gt; YOU LED ME TO BELIEVE THAT

00:01:28.048 --> 00:01:33.787
YOU AND I WERE ON THE SAME PAGE.

00:01:30.818 --> 00:01:35.289
OUR INABILITY TO REACH AN

00:01:33.921 --> 00:01:36.890
