00:01:38.358 --> 00:01:40.794
DOUBLE TALK.

00:01:39.059 --> 00:01:42.029
&gt;&gt; SARAH'S HUSBAND HAS MANY MORE

00:01:40.928 --> 00:01:43.864
THAN 100 SURGERIES SINCE BEING

00:01:42.162 --> 00:01:45.098
WOUNDED IN AFGHANISTAN.

00:01:43.997 --> 00:01:48.268
