00:01:45.232 --> 00:01:49.770
&gt;&gt; WE NEED A SECRETARY IN THERE

00:01:48.402 --> 00:01:50.737
WHO IS EMPOWERING AND ENACTING

00:01:49.903 --> 00:01:52.272
