00:01:53.974 --> 00:01:57.878
IT'S A STAIN ON OUR NATION AND

00:01:55.843 --> 00:01:58.178
WE OWE THESE HEROES SO MUCH

00:01:58.011 --> 00:02:00.214
MORE.

00:01:58.312 --> 00:02:02.482
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT TRUMP'S NOMINEE TO

00:02:00.347 --> 00:02:02.816
